From 1d660724864e2b6d6a6f2b8dfb71a6a584178d20 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gus bourg <gus@bourg.net>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 20:18:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 13/17] media: amlogic: amvdec: add stateless VP9 decoding

Add VP9_FRAME decoding with request reference slots and per-frame
controls. Accept coded dimensions down to eight pixels and keep the
control copy in session scratch storage.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-fable-5-1
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5.6
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.0
